Projectify supports both ''Due (Deadline)'' dates and ''Start (Scheduled)'' dates, as well as ''Recurring Tasks'':

!! Due Dates vs. Start (Scheduled) Dates

* ''Due Date (`due`)'': The deadline by which a task must be completed. Overdue tasks are highlighted in red and surfaced at the top of the [[Today|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/dashboard/Today]] tab.
* ''Start / Scheduled Date (`scheduled`)'': The date you intend to begin working on a task (GTD "tickler" / defer date). Tasks with a future Start Date stay out of [[Next Actions|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/NextActions]] until their start date arrives, and then automatically appear in ''Today'' and ''Next Actions''.

Switch between ''Due (Deadline)'' and ''Start (Scheduled)'' at the top of any date picker, or use inline smart tokens when adding a task (`@today`, `@tomorrow`, `@nextweek`, `@YYYY-MM-DD` for due dates; `~today`, `~tomorrow`, `~YYYY-MM-DD` for start dates).

!! Recurring Tasks

In the date picker's ''Repeat'' selector, you can set a task to repeat `daily`, `weekdays`, `weekly`, `monthly`, or `yearly` (or set the `recur` field to custom intervals like `+3d`, `+2w`, `+6m`, `+1y`).

When you check off a recurring task, Projectify automatically advances its due/scheduled date to the next occurrence and records the completion in `last-completed` instead of closing the task permanently.

!! Overdue Triage

When tasks slip past their due date, use the ''{{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/images/sun}} Reschedule all to Today'' button at the top of the ''Today'' tab to batch-update all overdue tasks to today in a single click.

!! Web Push Notifications & Focus Timers (TiddlyPWA)

When running inside a [[TiddlyPWA|https://github.com/mblackman/tiddlypwa]] wiki with Web Push enabled:

* ''Declarative Due & Start Date Rules (`$:/tags/NotificationRule`)'': Projectify ships with two zero-knowledge encrypted notification rules (`$:/config/projectify/notifications/TodoDueRule` and `$:/config/projectify/notifications/TodoScheduledRule`) that automatically alert your subscribed devices on the morning a task is due or scheduled to start (configurable under `$:/ControlPanel` → ''Projectify'' → ''Notifications'').
* ''Quick Reminders & 25m Focus Timers (`tm-pwa-schedule-notification`)'': Open any task's schedule popup or `...` actions menu to schedule a one-off push reminder (`+15m`, `+1h`, `+3h`), start a ''🍅 25m'' Pomodoro focus timer, or schedule a ''Weekly Review'' reminder from the Review tab.
* ''Interactive Notification Actions (`th-pwa-notification-action`)'': Click ''Mark Done'' directly on a push notification to complete the task (or advance a recurring task to its next occurrence), or click ''Snooze 1h'' to reschedule the reminder.
